<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.json">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#1a237e">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/icons/icon-192.png">
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
    <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <style>
        .module-card {
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }
        .module-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }
        .module-header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a237e, #0d47a1);
            color: white;
            padding: 1rem;
            border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;
        }
        .module-content {
            padding: 1.5rem;
        }
        .module-topics {
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }
        .module-topics li {
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        .certification-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #e8eaf6;
            color: #3f51b5;
            padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
            border-radius: 15px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            margin: 0.25rem;
            border: 1px solid #c5cae9;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="/"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Dashboard</a>
        <a href="/python-report"><i class="fab fa-python"></i> Python</a>
        <a href="/java-report"><i class="fab fa-java"></i> Java</a>
        <a href="/ai-report"><i class="fas fa-brain"></i> AI</a>
        <a href="/azure-report"><i class="fab fa-microsoft"></i> Azure</a>
        <a href="/powerbi-report"><i class="fas fa-chart-bar"></i> Power BI</a>
        <a href="/calendar"><i class="far fa-calendar-alt"></i> Calendar</a>
        <a href="/curriculum" class="active"><i class="fas fa-book"></i> Curriculum</a>
    </div>

    <div class="header">
        <div class="container">
            <h1 class="display-4">Curriculum 2025</h1>
            <p class="lead">Comprehensive Certification Curriculum Overview</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="row mb-4">
            <div class="col-12">
                <div class="card p-4">
                    <h2>Curriculum Overview</h2>
                    <p>This curriculum provides a comprehensive roadmap for students pursuing various technical certifications in 2025. Each module is designed to prepare students for industry-recognized certifications while developing practical skills for real-world applications.</p>
                    
                    <div class="mt-3">
                        <h4>Learning Approach</h4>
                        <p>Our curriculum follows a blended learning approach with:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Instructor-led sessions (40%)</li>
                            <li>Hands-on labs and projects (40%)</li>
                            <li>Self-paced learning and practice tests (20%)</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row">
            <!-- Python Module -->
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="card module-card">
                    <div class="module-header">
                        <h3><i class="fab fa-python"></i> Python Programming</h3>
                        <div>
                            <span class="certification-badge">Python Certified Associate</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="module-content">
                        <p>This module covers Python programming fundamentals through advanced concepts, preparing students for the Python Certified Associate exam.</p>
                        
                        <div class="module-topics">
                            <h5>Key Topics:</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Python syntax and data structures</li>
                                <li>Object-oriented programming</li>
                                <li>File handling and exceptions</li>
                                <li>Modules and packages</li>
                                <li>Data analysis with NumPy and Pandas</li>
                                <li>Web development with Flask</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="mt-3">
                            <h5>Duration:</h5>
                            <p>8 weeks (January - February 2025)</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Java Module -->
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="card module-card">
                    <div class="module-header">
                        <h3><i class="fab fa-java"></i> Java Programming</h3>
                        <div>
                            <span class="certification-badge">Java SE 8 Programmer</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="module-content">
                        <p>This module covers Java programming from basics to advanced concepts, preparing students for the Java SE 8 Programmer certification.</p>
                        
                        <div class="module-topics">
                            <h5>Key Topics:</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Java language fundamentals</li>
                                <li>Object-oriented programming</li>
                                <li>Exception handling</li>
                                <li>Collections framework</li>
                                <li>Functional programming with lambdas</li>
                                <li>Stream API and concurrency</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="mt-3">
                            <h5>Duration:</h5>
                            <p>8 weeks (January - February 2025)</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Azure Module -->
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="card module-card">
                    <div class="module-header">
                        <h3><i class="fab fa-microsoft"></i> Azure Fundamentals</h3>
                        <div>
                            <span class="certification-badge">AZ-900</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="module-content">
                        <p>This module introduces students to cloud concepts and Microsoft Azure services, preparing them for the Azure Fundamentals certification.</p>
                        
                        <div class="module-topics">
                            <h5>Key Topics:</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Cloud concepts and service models</li>
                                <li>Azure core services and management tools</li>
                                <li>Security, privacy, compliance, and trust</li>
                                <li>Azure pricing and support</li>
                                <li>Identity, governance, and compliance features</li>
                                <li>Azure resource management</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="mt-3">
                            <h5>Duration:</h5>
                            <p>4 weeks (February 2025)</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Azure AI Module -->
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="card module-card">
                    <div class="module-header">
                        <h3><i class="fas fa-brain"></i> Azure AI Fundamentals</h3>
                        <div>
                            <span class="certification-badge">AI-900</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="module-content">
                        <p>This module introduces artificial intelligence concepts and Microsoft Azure AI services, preparing students for the Azure AI Fundamentals certification.</p>
                        
                        <div class="module-topics">
                            <h5>Key Topics:</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Introduction to AI and machine learning</li>
                                <li>Computer vision workloads</li>
                                <li>Natural language processing</li>
                                <li>Conversational AI</li>
                                <li>Azure Cognitive Services</li>
                                <li>Responsible AI principles</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="mt-3">
                            <h5>Duration:</h5>
                            <p>4 weeks (February - March 2025)</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Power BI Module -->
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="card module-card">
                    <div class="module-header">
                        <h3><i class="fas fa-chart-bar"></i> Power BI</h3>
                        <div>
                            <span class="certification-badge">PL-300</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="module-content">
                        <p>This module covers data visualization and business intelligence using Microsoft Power BI, preparing students for the Power BI Data Analyst certification.</p>
                        
                        <div class="module-topics">
                            <h5>Key Topics:</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Data preparation and transformation</li>
                                <li>Data modeling and relationships</li>
                                <li>Visualization creation and configuration</li>
                                <li>DAX formulas and measures</li>
                                <li>Report design and formatting</li>
                                <li>Dashboard creation and sharing</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="mt-3">
                            <h5>Duration:</h5>
                            <p>4 weeks (March 2025)</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Advanced Certifications -->
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="card module-card">
                    <div class="module-header">
                        <h3><i class="fas fa-award"></i> Advanced Certifications</h3>
                        <div>
                            <span class="certification-badge">Various</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="module-content">
                        <p>Advanced certification tracks for students who have completed the foundational certifications and want to specialize further.</p>
                        
                        <div class="module-topics">
                            <h5>Available Tracks:</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Azure Administrator (AZ-104)</li>
                                <li>Azure Developer (AZ-204)</li>
                                <li>Azure Solutions Architect (AZ-305)</li>
                                <li>Java EE Developer</li>
                                <li>Python Data Science</li>
                                <li>AI Engineer (AI-102)</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="mt-3">
                            <h5>Duration:</h5>
                            <p>8-12 weeks (April - June 2025)</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row mt-4">
            <div class="col-12">
                <div class="card p-4">
                    <h3>Learning Resources</h3>
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <h5>Core Materials</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Official certification study guides</li>
                                <li>Interactive lab environments</li>
                                <li>Practice test platforms</li>
                                <li>Video courses and tutorials</li>
                                <li>Hands-on projects and case studies</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <h5>Support Services</h5>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Weekly mentoring sessions</li>
                                <li>Peer study groups</li>
                                <li>Technical support forums</li>
                                <li>Industry expert guest lectures</li>
                                <li>Career counseling and job placement assistance</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="bg-light py-3 mt-5">
        <div class="container text-center">
            <p class="text-muted mb-0">Curriculum 2025 • Generated by Andre Snell, Senior Facilitator • March 2025</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
